n>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"ticket-actions\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-1-4\" data-name=\"ticket actions\">\n                        <a class=\"rsvp\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"rsvp action link\" href=\"#top\">\n                            STAY INFORMED\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"arrow icon\">\n                                ↗\n                            </span>\n                        </a>\n                        <span class=\"ticket-note\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"ticket note text\">\n                            Elevated experiences. Refined storytelling. A night worthy of the legacy.\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"ticket-art\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2\" data-name=\"ticket art container\">\n                    <img alt=\"Grand Gala Night at Mr and Miss Unibadan\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2-1\" data-name=\"ticket art image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/Images-Carousels/IMG_4695.PNG\">\n                    <div class=\"ticket-top mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2-2\" data-name=\"ticket top container\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"ticket top label\">\n                            MR & MISS UI / 2026\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"ticket id code\">\n                            001 / 001\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"ticket-bottom\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2-3\" data-name=\"ticket bottom container\">\n                        <span class=\"large-number\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"large number\">\n                            15\n                        </span>\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"barcode\" data-kid=\"1-2-7